OL,3,GNEWSAYellow rainfall warning for parts
OL,4,Aof Northern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rainfall warning was issued for parts
OL,7,Fof Northern Ireland on Sunday, with the
OL,8,Fpotential for travel disruption.
OL,10,FThe Met Office yellow alert, which
OL,11,Flasted until 14:00 BST, warned of
OL,12,Fintense rainfall before conditions
OL,13,Fimproved.
OL,15,FThe organisation expected between
OL,16,F20-40mm of rain falling in just a few
OL,17,Fhours in some places.
OL,19,FIt also warned of a possibility that a
OL,20,Fsmall number of homes and businesses
OL,21,Fcould be flooded.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
